      "user_view_type": "public",
      "site_admin": false
    },
    "body": "I guess this was not entirely obvious in the other PR, but this needs to directly invoke https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-current-high-resolution-time. The primitives defined in that specification are what all web platform specifications hook into.\r\n\r\nI also wonder if we can get more context on nsMinInstant and nsMaxInstant as `performance.now()` and other APIs don't have that.\r\n\r\n(I do think it makes sense for HTML to define the implementation of the hook as HTML generally manages the hooks.)",
